The following are equivalent. 
    \begin{enumerate}
      \item \( \Gamma \) is inconsistent.
      \item \( \Gamma \Proves {!A} \) for every !!{sentence}~\( {!A} \).
      \item \( \Gamma \Proves {!A} \) and \( \Gamma \Proves \lnot {!A} \) for some !!{sentence}~\( {!A} \).
    \end{enumerate}
